 # its parent's, up to three levels up; refused when it is this sheet, has this sheet as an ancestor, or was never loaded.
+# fiscal-start-month (not dated): the month a fiscal year starts in, a whole number from 1 to 12 (1 unless set).
 # Any other key or value is refused (400) and nothing is stored. A stored change is recorded in the
 # audit file as SETTING_CHANGED, ending from=<date> when a from-date was given (even when the value is the one already in force), then ROLLUP/TOTALS
 # for the figures it moved; a refused one records nothing.
